{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-7","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be that part of a number, which a number subtracted is of a number subtracted, the remainder will also be the same part of the remainder that the whole is of the whole.","book":7,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","contentId":"euclid-7-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad5f2ae37cda12162eee39000117de128702d81bebe2105c636b49f505c2e02f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-7.statement","euclid-7-7.construction.1","euclid-7-7.proof.1","euclid-7-7.proof.2","euclid-7-7.proof.3","euclid-7-7.construction.2","euclid-7-7.proof.4","euclid-7-7.conclusion","euclid-7-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c7ff8d8440326cf3269aeac366aff25fb9e040121eddf0bf7b30b760ff56f14","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be that part of a number, which a number subtracted is of a number subtracted, the remainder will also be the same part of the remainder that the whole is of the whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字的一部分是数字,减去数字的一部分是数字,则其余部分也是其余部分,即整个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74681bf8969abbdaa133297075389fafc881d286bf7a3df6daa5ffd65e464b01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number AB be that part of the number CD which AE subtracted is of CF subtracted; I say that the remainder EB is also the same part of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB数字是CD数字中减去AE数字的一部分,CF数字是减去的;我说,其余EB数字也是其余FD数字的一部分,即整个AB数字是全部CD数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e17f53a340696f2de1c3c67bec6caf12d7b276887697bdab3105dd9358d355ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also let EB be of CG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,不管AE部分是CF部分,同一部分也让EB部分是CG部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3b8ead2863bb4f93ca498123d6b98c0cee3541907b0c5e068a8ac5665919fb1","citations":["euclid-7-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also is EB of CG, therefore, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also is AB of GF. [[VII. 5](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,无论第AE部分是CF部分,同一部分也是CG部分中的EB部分,因此,无论第AE部分是CF部分,同一部分也是GF部分中的AB部分。 [[VII. 5](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebabac4a3df8d73c03672fa17e801fb95e6d9929f5d49e0e3f80637ca0df7419","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also, by hypothesis, is AB of CD; therefore, whatever part AB is of GF, the same part is it of CD also; therefore GF is equal to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,不管第AE部分是CF部分,假设也是CD部分中的AB部分;因此,第AB部分是GF部分,同样部分是CD部分;因此,GF部分等于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbc8708dee02931a62924136cf0ee21e9044dbd114c96dba125b7a2ab99cf7b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CF be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder GC is equal to the remainder FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人减去CF美元,其余GC美元等于其余FD美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e916a6912b04da5163a5c82eb041137b5c6a880bbd6f7ecd0ecb373d8c0f8e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also is EB of GC, while GC is equal to FD, therefore, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also is EB of FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,无论第AE部分是CF部分,同一部分也是GC份中的EB份,而第GC份等于FD份,因此,不管第AE份是CF份,同一部分也是FD份中的EB份。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f76934e249471d30fa5d40e9a95c376e5830a1680b96d67537e7f5a8b616f8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, whatever part AE is of CF, the same part also is AB of CD; therefore also the remainder EB is the same part of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,不管第AE部分是CF部分,同一部分也是CD部分中的AB部分;因此,其余EB部分是其余FD部分,即整个AB部分是CD部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-7.source","contentId":"euclid-7-7","revisionId":"euclid-7-7@raw-ad5f2ae37cda1216","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e6d20fee460ba68d341ae5d0e412ea3d838062813e6a837e59f65c111c3d62c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-7:euclid-7-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-7.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"VII. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-8:euclid-7-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-8.proof.3","euclid-7-8.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VII. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-11.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"VII. 7, 8"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-7:euclid-7-5:explicit","id":"euclid-7-5","book":7,"number":5,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-8:euclid-7-7:explicit","id":"euclid-7-8","book":7,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-7:explicit","id":"euclid-7-11","book":7,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
